+        // m_c64.clock() dispatches one scheduler event, not one cycle, and an
+        // event can carry time forward by anything from a single cycle to a
+        // whole CIA timer period. Run to a deadline on the scheduler's own
+        // clock so the argument is the cycle count this call is documented to
+        // take, and so the SIDs are never handed more audio than they can hold.
+        //
+        // An event may also be scheduled at the time it fires, which advances
